[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":48,"col":10},"end":{"line":48,"col":21}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"The subscription at Push.beni:21:29 hands its values to a tagger that does not\ngive one of the program's message keys with the value as its field, and\n`browser-inline` calls the handler of that key with each value directly, with no\nmessage made (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §3; §5, class 3). Give the message\na constructor that takes the value — `Pushed Value`, tagged with `Pushed` — and\ntell its messages apart from the others' with a `case` on the message in\n`update`."}]
